What?

261
00:14:59,073 --> 00:15:00,760
Nico Robbins here? Where at?

262
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:01,860
Hunt her down!

263
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,746
Turn her into the government!

264
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:09,180
I can't believe it.

265
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:10,740
A Poneglyph.

266
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,320
Stay away!

267
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:15,157
I have nothing to sell
to the likes of you!

268
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,237
Look, I'm 16.

269
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,660
I'll do anything.

270
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:20,097
Please just allow me to join your group.

271
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:22,200
You betrayed me, you damn witch!

272
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:27,660
Nico Robin, I'd like you to assist me.

273
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:32,320
I've been told you can read Poneglyphs.

274
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:41,000
If you trigger a Buster Call,
everything will be destroyed.

275
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:44,200
That includes all of Eni's lobby.

276
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:50,240
And most likely, you as well.

277
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:51,750
Nonsense!

278
00:15:51,980 --> 00:15:53,156
What are you saying?

279
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,620
They wouldn't kill a VIP like me!

280
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:57,800
I'm not falling for your bluff!

281
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:01,960
Twenty years ago, everything
was taken from me.

282
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:04,440
And many innocent lives were lost.

283
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:09,160
With one push of a button,
I summoned a terrible demon.

284
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,960
Now it rears its head again,

285
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:16,106
aiming its sights on the friends
I've searched so hard to find.

286
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,657
The more that I wish
for us to be together,

287
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:22,740
the more my ugly fate
bears its fangs at you.

288
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:28,700
Even now, no matter how far we sail, there's
an enemy that haunts me at every turn.

289
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:33,340
Because I'm facing the world
and all of its darkness.

290
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:37,140
First it was Aokiji, and now CP9.

291
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,404
I've dragged you into my
troubles twice already.

292
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:45,940
If it goes on and on like this,
no matter how kind you may be,

293
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:49,597
Someday you'll see me as a burden!

294
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:52,837
Someday you'll be forced to
betray me and throw me away!

295
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:55,580
That's what I'm most
afraid of! Understand?

296
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:58,037
That's why I didn't want you to rescue me!

297
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:02,740
If that's the only future I have,
I'd rather die to save me the pain!

298
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:08,690
Robin...

299
00:17:08,773 --> 00:17:10,320
I never knew...

300
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:13,370
Robin...

301
00:17:13,453 --> 00:17:14,440
I see.

302
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,680
So that's it.

303
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:19,900
There you have it!

304
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,600
Yep, right on the mark!

305
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,400
What a sorry case!

306
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:27,677
Even if you make friends, all you can do
is drag them through the mud with you.

307
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:30,940
You can't win, pirates!

308
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,219
Look at this flag!

309
00:17:34,540 --> 00:17:38,600
This symbol represents the
unity of over 170 nations,

310
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:42,397
a power that spans the four
seas and the Grand Line.

311
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,437
This is the world itself.

312
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:48,677
No matter how loud your bark may be, you
can't stand up to an enemy like that.

313
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:49,757
Just face it already.

314
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:52,897
Do you realize how strong
our organization is?

315
00:17:52,980 --> 00:17:55,917
Do you realize how devoted
we are to capturing her?

316
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:59,317
If that's Robin's enemy,
then I know what to do.

317
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,080
Sniper King,

318
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:05,157
shoot down that flag.

319
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,337
Roger.

320
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:11,957
This is my new weapon, a massive
slingshot by the name of Kavuto.

321
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,180
Behold its awesome power!

322
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:17,480
Special attack, Firebird Star!

323
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,760
No way!

324
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,280
Mission complete.

325
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:39,020
Oh, now they've done it! Those idiots!

326
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:40,877
You can't fire on a government flag!

327
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:41,980
That's crazy!

328
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:47,320
Those pirates just declared war
against the world government!

329
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:49,960
You're all going to die!

330
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:54,400
You morons can't challenge the
entire world and expect to win! Yeah?

331
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,840
Bring it on!

332
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:09,330
Robin!

333
00:19:11,100 --> 00:19:14,400
There's still something
I want to hear you say!

334
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:21,380
Tell me you want to live!

335
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:26,460
Robin.

336
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:32,120
Robin.

337
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:36,240
I can live.

338
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,060
Face it!

339
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:40,888
Your whole existence
is nothing but a crime!

340
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:43,177
The whole world's against you, Robin!

341
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:44,966
You can't be allowed to live!

342
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:49,200
I never dared to wish
for something like that.

343
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:54,640
The world had denied me that hope.

344
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,320
I just want to die!

345
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:02,400
The sea's a vast place, so I guarantee...

346
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:06,940
Someday you'll find friends
who won't ever leave you.

347
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,840
Believe in Luffy.

348
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:24,440
But now, if I'm allowed to
say my wish just this once,

349
00:20:26,220 --> 00:20:27,897
then I...

350
00:20:27,980 --> 00:20:30,340
I want to live!

351
00:20:31,340 --> 00:20:32,170
No!

352
00:20:32,253 --> 00:20:33,083
Take me with you!

353
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,880
Take me away from here!

354
00:21:00,340 --> 00:21:02,540
Oh, you guys, you're so awesome!

355
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:04,000
I love you!

356
00:21:05,360 --> 00:21:06,420
Let's go!
